{"id":"n15431-1-7","stage":1,"title":"미용실 · 发廊","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15431-1-7-1","ko":"파마를 했구나. 어느 미용실에서 했어?","zh":"你做了卷发啊。是在哪家理发店做的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"파마를","meaning":"烫发","explanation":"파마：烫发；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"파마","audio":"/audio/78d387fc9d18c04a403b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82317","senseId":"1","lemma":"파마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했구나.","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어느","meaning":"哪，哪个","explanation":"어느：哪，哪个","readings":[{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62822","senseId":"3","lemma":"어느","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미용실에서","meaning":"发廊，美发厅，理发厅","explanation":"미용실：发廊，美发厅，理发厅；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"미용실","audio":"/audio/9f4f9d50afd9fc9a7edb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15431","senseId":"1","lemma":"미용실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했어?","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"78d387fc9d18c04a","term":"파마","zh":"烫发","audio":"/audio/78d387fc9d18c04a403b.mp3","entryId":"82317","definition":"使用机器、药物等使头发卷曲或拉直后使之长时间维持这种状态；或指那样的头发。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，作，置办","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"制作或准备什么东西。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"76e7139b030308e7","term":"어느","zh":"哪，哪个","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3","entryId":"62822","definition":"不管任何人或物。","pronunciation":["어느"]},{"id":"9f4f9d50afd9fc9a","term":"미용실","zh":"发廊，美发厅，理发厅","audio":"/audio/9f4f9d50afd9fc9a7edb.mp3","entryId":"15431","definition":"提供剪发、染发、烫发、化妆等服务的营业场所。","pronunciation":["미ː용실"]}],"audio":"/audio/839134e625c3533e787e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15431-1-7-2","ko":"아주 머리 손질을 잘하는 곳이 있는데, 다음에 같이 갈래?","zh":"有家理发店很擅长打理头发，下次我们一起过去吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"머리","meaning":"头发","explanation":"머리：头发","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"3","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손질을","meaning":"收拾，打理","explanation":"손질：收拾，打理；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"손질","audio":"/audio/57cf31b47eedddd5bb3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15606","senseId":"1","lemma":"손질","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘하는","meaning":"善于，擅长","explanation":"잘하다：善于，擅长；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳이","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는데,","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음에","meaning":"下面，下一个","explanation":"다음：下面，下一个；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"2","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈래?","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄹ래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头发","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"生长在头上的毛发。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"57cf31b47eedddd5","term":"손질","zh":"收拾，打理","audio":"/audio/57cf31b47eedddd5bb3e.mp3","entryId":"15606","definition":"用手抚摸整理东西。","pronunciation":["손질"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"善于，擅长","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"熟练且手艺好。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"下面，下一个","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"这个次序的后一个。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bacd0137e0670e5a16b9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.705,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15431","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.3584,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["有家理发店很擅长打理头发，下次我们一起过去吧？","你做了卷发啊。是在哪家理发店做的？","快把门打开吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你做了卷发啊。是在哪家理发店做的？","快把门打开吧。","有家理发店很擅长打理头发，下次我们一起过去吧？"],"answer":2}]}
